  "summary": "A pictorial carpet, picture carpet, tableau rug, carpet tableau or rug tableau (Persian: تابلو فرش) is an ornamental rug specially prepared for hanging on room and hall walls for decoration.",
  "description": "A pictorial carpet, picture carpet, tableau rug, carpet tableau or rug tableau (Persian: تابلو فرش) is an ornamental rug specially prepared for hanging on room and hall walls for decoration. Unlike common floor rugs, pictorial carpets are often framed and differ in their design. Pictorial carpets are generally made of silk but have also been made from wool.",
